Regie Ocampo posted a new assignment in Robotics 9-Einstein 9-Einstein  
<https://classroom.google.com/c/MTIxODQxNzkyNDQ2>.

Due: Nov 18
Circuit Diagram: Draw in sheet of paper and submit your answer in a photo
Draw circuit diagrams of the following components:
1. Series circuit that involves a battery, voltmeter, lamp and buzzer
2. Parallel circuit that is powered by a battery and connects ammeter, lamp  
and buzzer
3. Series circuit that involves a battery, motor, lamp and buzzer
4. Parallel circuit that is powered by three cells and connects ammeter,  
lamp and buzzer
